#: ../doc/introduction.rst:21
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#: ../doc/introduction.rst:23
msgid ""
"OpenShot Video Editor is an award-winning, open-source video editor, "
"available on Linux, macOS, Chrome OS, and Windows. OpenShot can create "
"stunning videos, films, and animations with an easy-to-use interface and "
"rich feature-set."
msgstr ""
"OpenShot Video Editor je nagrađivani, otvoreni video uređivač, dostupan na "
"Linuxu, macOS-u, Chrome OS-u i Windowsu. OpenShot može stvarati zadivljujuće"
" videozapise, filmove i animacije s jednostavnim sučeljem i bogatim skupom "
"značajki."

